{"detail": {"templateUuid": "f02de4a5b39d413581af85f13c58338e", "projectUuid": "2cc36a58b5a64042bc1fee0bcb29d244", "name": "AI短片｜第九条鱼", "description": "信天翁号没有沉没，但有九个人在那个夜晚消失。\n\n船长以为只要关上那扇门，记忆就会像货物一样被封存。\n这不仅是一个关于海难的故事，更是一场关于“自我防御机制”的心理拆解。船长在贪婪下的决策，导致了不可挽回的惨剧。为了活下去，他的精神分裂成了三个切面：虚构英雄主义的“幸存者”、化身受害者的“溺水者”、以及失忆的“逃避者”。\n\n他在病房里演得天衣无缝，甚至连自己都骗过了。\n可内心的深处里，那8条鱼始终在盯着他。\n\n“老板，货保住了，我的钱呢？”\n“疯子的话，谁会相信呢？”\n\n那一刻，第九条鱼终于游出了水面。", "coverUrl": "/assets/8b5021c060a0ca8b.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/cfd54f65a64c4aa989dd9f7d36a383e0/228cd5b0fac57b6fc979124f68ace48389310470.mp4", "snapshotId": 5849, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 8351234, "ownerUuid": "cfd54f65a64c4aa989dd9f7d36a383e0", "avatar": "/assets/62211e4b8940b5d4.webp", "nickname": "都都沉Doc", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 2, "tags": [{"id": 3021, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "AI影像狂飙季", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3021/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3022, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "短片单元", "parentTag": 3021, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3021/3022", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "http://xhslink.com/o/9zBMAFyduTY", "createAt": "2026年04月16日 22:56", "updateAt": "2026年04月18日 17:25", "publishAt": "2026年04月16日 22:56", "honors": ["短片单元-入围"], "awardedTag": ["短片单元-入围"], "playCount": 8, "viewCreationProcessCount": 0, "copyCanvasCount": 0, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/f02de4a5b39d413581af85f13c58338e.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 114, "edges": 70}}, "recommendList": []}